==========================================

MedOrbits Local Agent -- Example Environment

File: .env.example

==========================================

Copy to .env for local development.

Never commit .env or put real credentials in this file.

All feature flags default to the safest configuration.

Verify each setting is enforced by the application before relying on it.

----------------------------

Application

----------------------------

NODE_ENV=development
AGENT_NAME="MedOrbits Local Agent"
AGENT_MODE=readonly

Loopback only. Do not expose the agent publicly.

HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=3035

----------------------------

Repository boundaries

----------------------------

Agent is nested inside the MedOrbits-global repository.

Resolve this path relative to the application’s working directory

only after validating and canonicalizing it in the configuration module.

AGENT_REPOSITORY_ROOT=..

Reject paths outside the canonical repository root.

AGENT_ENFORCE_REPOSITORY_BOUNDARY=true
AGENT_REJECT_SYMLINKS=true
AGENT_ALLOW_ABSOLUTE_PATHS=false
AGENT_ALLOW_HIDDEN_FILES=false

----------------------------

Local Ollama

----------------------------

OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b
OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
OLLAMA_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS=5000

Generation parameters.

OLLAMA_TEMPERATURE=0.2
OLLAMA_TOP_P=0.9
OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=8192

----------------------------

Safety and approvals

----------------------------

AGENT_ALLOW_FILE_WRITES=false
AGENT_REQUIRE_APPROVAL=true
AGENT_ALLOW_SHELL_EXECUTION=false
AGENT_ALLOW_GIT_MUTATIONS=false
AGENT_ALLOW_DEPLOYMENT=false
AGENT_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_NETWORK=false

Require explicit confirmation before applying a proposed change.

AGENT_REQUIRE_CHANGE_PREVIEW=true
AGENT_REQUIRE_BACKUP_BEFORE_WRITE=true
AGENT_ALLOW_DELETE=false
AGENT_ALLOW_RENAME=false
AGENT_ALLOW_SYMLINK_CREATION=false

Never treat a model-generated plan as authorization.

AGENT_TRUST_MODEL_OUTPUT=false

----------------------------

Request and resource limits

----------------------------

AGENT_MAX_PROMPT_LENGTH=100000
AGENT_MAX_SYSTEM_PROMPT_LENGTH=30000
AGENT_MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES=1048576
AGENT_MAX_TOTAL_READ_BYTES=20971520
AGENT_MAX_FILES_PER_SCAN=2000
AGENT_MAX_SCAN_DEPTH=20
AGENT_MAX_RESPONSE_LENGTH=2000000
AGENT_MAX_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS=2
AGENT_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=120000

----------------------------

Proposals and approvals

----------------------------

AGENT_PROPOSAL_TTL_MS=1800000
AGENT_MAX_PENDING_PROPOSALS=20
AGENT_APPROVAL_TOKEN_REQUIRED=true

Optional local approval token.

Leave blank until token handling is implemented securely.

Do not use a short or predictable token.

AGENT_APPROVAL_TOKEN=

----------------------------

Reports and backups

----------------------------

AGENT_REPORTS_DIR=reports
AGENT_BACKUPS_DIR=.agent-backups
AGENT_MAX_BACKUP_SIZE_BYTES=20971520
AGENT_RETAIN_REPORTS_DAYS=14

----------------------------

Logging

----------------------------

LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_FORMAT=json
LOG_TO_CONSOLE=true

Leave blank to disable file logging.

LOG_FILE=

Do not log prompts, credentials, access tokens, or full file contents.

AGENT_REDACT_LOG_SECRETS=true

----------------------------

HTTP and local API

----------------------------

Keep browser access restricted to the local UI.

AGENT_CORS_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:3035,http://localhost:3035
AGENT_ENABLE_RATE_LIMIT=true
AGENT_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
AGENT_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=60

----------------------------

Optional integrations

----------------------------

Leave blank unless the integration is implemented.

Store real credentials in a local, untracked .env file.

AI_API_KEY=
AI_API_URL=
AI_MODEL=

----------------------------

Development and diagnostics

----------------------------

AGENT_DEBUG=false
AGENT_ENABLE_METRICS=false
AGENT_ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_FEATURES=false